{
  "schema_version": "text-light-input-1.0",
  "unit_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_u01",
  "video_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8",
  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，七月半中元节烧纸是迷信吗，不是，中元节烧的不单单是纸，而是未报的那份恩情，曾经带你上坟的人，成为了等你去给他上坟的人。如果七月半他们真的能回来一天，该有多好。#中元节 #七月半 #祭祖 #祭祀",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 159.72,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱君，你觉得七月半烧纸是迷信吗？不是中元节烧的，不单单是纸，而是未报的那份恩情。曾经带你上坟的人，成了等你去给他上坟的人，你知道吗？中元节并不是鬼节，而是中国人的思念节。小时候怕鬼，长大了以后才发现，真正让人难过的是这个世界上已经没有那个你想见的人。如果七月半他们真的能够回来一天该有多好。人到中年，再听见七月半想到的是爷爷奶奶，是父母，是故乡，是小时候那张已经坐不满的饭桌。你有没有发现，当你烧纸的时候，不管你站在哪个方向，那烟和火都会吹向你。故人轻拂，金人眉，为尔抹去半生灾。清明节是我们去看故人，中元节是故人来看我们。你知道经常上坟和不上坟的人有什么区别吗？人长大之后，突然就不再害怕上坟。人到中年，突然开始理解，祭祖在中国，佛你可以不拜神，你可以不敬，但祖先不能不祭死。为什么？因为佛有他的寺庙，神有他的道观，如果祖先不祭祀的话，就变成了孤魂野鬼。所以中元节一定要祭祖，死亡，不是终点，遗忘才是。只要还有人记得你，你就仍然活在这个世界的某个角落。如果烧纸都算迷信的话，那过生日点蜡烛，许愿也是迷信了，对着一块蛋糕都能许愿的人，凭什么去嘲笑别人的信仰？中国人很少说我想你，于是把思念直接藏进了七月半，烧一炷香，献一束花，做一道他生前最喜欢吃的菜。中元节最大的意义是提醒我们，后仰博葬。中元节最应该烧给父母的不是纸钱，而是趁他们还在的时候，多陪他们吃几顿饭，别把所有的思念都留到只能思念的时候，好好陪家人，好好过自己的人生。因为我们今天认真生活的样子，也会成为后辈关于我们的记忆。所谓慎终追远，就是趁一切还来得及，好好珍惜眼前人。朱军，如果中元节这一天，你已经离开的亲人，真的可以回来一天。你最想带他去哪里？我想很多人的答案并不是去什么多么昂贵的地方，可能只是再回一次老家的房子，再吃一次妈妈做的饭，让爷爷看看自己现在的孩子，告诉奶奶，我现在过得挺好，你不用担心，甚至什么都不用做，就想再和他坐一会儿。又到一年，中元节，记得去看望我们的祖先，轻声说一句，爷爷奶奶。我想你们。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00001",
      "start_ms": 530,
      "end_ms": 930,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1330,
      "end_ms": 3850,
      "text": "你觉得七月半烧纸是迷信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4250,
      "end_ms": 6190,
      "text": "不是中元节烧的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6190,
      "end_ms": 7030,
      "text": "不单单是纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7210,
      "end_ms": 8710,
      "text": "而是未报的那份恩情。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9150,
      "end_ms": 10730,
      "text": "曾经带你上坟的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10970,
      "end_ms": 13250,
      "text": "成了等你去给他上坟的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13610,
      "end_ms": 14230,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14230,
      "end_ms": 15770,
      "text": "中元节并不是鬼节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15970,
      "end_ms": 17490,
      "text": "而是中国人的思念节。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17810,
      "end_ms": 18870,
      "text": "小时候怕鬼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19130,
      "end_ms": 20310,
      "text": "长大了以后才发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20330,
      "end_ms": 24910,
      "text": "真正让人难过的是这个世界上已经没有那个你想见的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00014",
      "start_ms": 25530,
      "end_ms": 29070,
      "text": "如果七月半他们真的能够回来一天该有多好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29070,
      "end_ms": 30880,
      "text": "人到中年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30940,
      "end_ms": 33860,
      "text": "再听见七月半想到的是爷爷奶奶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33940,
      "end_ms": 34640,
      "text": "是父母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00018",
      "start_ms": 34840,
      "end_ms": 35540,
      "text": "是故乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00019",
      "start_ms": 35840,
      "end_ms": 38300,
      "text": "是小时候那张已经坐不满的饭桌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00020",
      "start_ms": 38800,
      "end_ms": 39600,
      "text": "你有没有发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39600,
      "end_ms": 40580,
      "text": "当你烧纸的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40580,
      "end_ms": 42000,
      "text": "不管你站在哪个方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00023",
      "start_ms": 42200,
      "end_ms": 44340,
      "text": "那烟和火都会吹向你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00024",
      "start_ms": 44680,
      "end_ms": 45700,
      "text": "故人轻拂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00025",
      "start_ms": 45760,
      "end_ms": 46419,
      "text": "金人眉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00026",
      "start_ms": 46660,
      "end_ms": 48340,
      "text": "为尔抹去半生灾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00027",
      "start_ms": 48880,
      "end_ms": 50680,
      "text": "清明节是我们去看故人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00028",
      "start_ms": 50860,
      "end_ms": 52780,
      "text": "中元节是故人来看我们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00029",
      "start_ms": 53260,
      "end_ms": 56480,
      "text": "你知道经常上坟和不上坟的人有什么区别吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56660,
      "end_ms": 57700,
      "text": "人长大之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57700,
      "end_ms": 59240,
      "text": "突然就不再害怕上坟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59620,
      "end_ms": 60590,
      "text": "人到中年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60650,
      "end_ms": 62050,
      "text": "突然开始理解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00034",
      "start_ms": 62050,
      "end_ms": 63530,
      "text": "祭祖在中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63710,
      "end_ms": 65370,
      "text": "佛你可以不拜神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00036",
      "start_ms": 65550,
      "end_ms": 66310,
      "text": "你可以不敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00037",
      "start_ms": 66430,
      "end_ms": 68235,
      "text": "但祖先不能不祭死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00038",
      "start_ms": 68530,
      "end_ms": 68975,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00039",
      "start_ms": 69190,
      "end_ms": 70550,
      "text": "因为佛有他的寺庙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00040",
      "start_ms": 70690,
      "end_ms": 71790,
      "text": "神有他的道观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00041",
      "start_ms": 72030,
      "end_ms": 73630,
      "text": "如果祖先不祭祀的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00042",
      "start_ms": 73650,
      "end_ms": 75190,
      "text": "就变成了孤魂野鬼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00043",
      "start_ms": 75410,
      "end_ms": 77325,
      "text": "所以中元节一定要祭祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00044",
      "start_ms": 77790,
      "end_ms": 78170,
      "text": "死亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00045",
      "start_ms": 78170,
      "end_ms": 78850,
      "text": "不是终点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00046",
      "start_ms": 78970,
      "end_ms": 79815,
      "text": "遗忘才是。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00047",
      "start_ms": 80110,
      "end_ms": 81490,
      "text": "只要还有人记得你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00048",
      "start_ms": 81510,
      "end_ms": 83875,
      "text": "你就仍然活在这个世界的某个角落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00049",
      "start_ms": 84400,
      "end_ms": 86060,
      "text": "如果烧纸都算迷信的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00050",
      "start_ms": 86100,
      "end_ms": 87320,
      "text": "那过生日点蜡烛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00051",
      "start_ms": 87320,
      "end_ms": 88565,
      "text": "许愿也是迷信了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00052",
      "start_ms": 88830,
      "end_ms": 90470,
      "text": "对着一块蛋糕都能许愿的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00053",
      "start_ms": 90470,
      "end_ms": 92265,
      "text": "凭什么去嘲笑别人的信仰？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00054",
      "start_ms": 92720,
      "end_ms": 94440,
      "text": "中国人很少说我想你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00055",
      "start_ms": 94620,
      "end_ms": 97005,
      "text": "于是把思念直接藏进了七月半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00056",
      "start_ms": 97320,
      "end_ms": 98060,
      "text": "烧一炷香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00057",
      "start_ms": 98240,
      "end_ms": 98940,
      "text": "献一束花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00058",
      "start_ms": 99100,
      "end_ms": 101235,
      "text": "做一道他生前最喜欢吃的菜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00059",
      "start_ms": 101710,
      "end_ms": 103790,
      "text": "中元节最大的意义是提醒我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00060",
      "start_ms": 103870,
      "end_ms": 105085,
      "text": "后仰博葬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00061",
      "start_ms": 105540,
      "end_ms": 107880,
      "text": "中元节最应该烧给父母的不是纸钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00062",
      "start_ms": 108140,
      "end_ms": 109780,
      "text": "而是趁他们还在的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00063",
      "start_ms": 109820,
      "end_ms": 111315,
      "text": "多陪他们吃几顿饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00064",
      "start_ms": 111790,
      "end_ms": 114950,
      "text": "别把所有的思念都留到只能思念的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00065",
      "start_ms": 115370,
      "end_ms": 116270,
      "text": "好好陪家人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00066",
      "start_ms": 116470,
      "end_ms": 117925,
      "text": "好好过自己的人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00067",
      "start_ms": 118350,
      "end_ms": 120365,
      "text": "因为我们今天认真生活的样子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00068",
      "start_ms": 120620,
      "end_ms": 122755,
      "text": "也会成为后辈关于我们的记忆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00069",
      "start_ms": 123340,
      "end_ms": 124780,
      "text": "所谓慎终追远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00070",
      "start_ms": 124920,
      "end_ms": 126385,
      "text": "就是趁一切还来得及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00071",
      "start_ms": 126660,
      "end_ms": 128015,
      "text": "好好珍惜眼前人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00072",
      "start_ms": 128660,
      "end_ms": 129040,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00073",
      "start_ms": 129340,
      "end_ms": 130700,
      "text": "如果中元节这一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00074",
      "start_ms": 130720,
      "end_ms": 131920,
      "text": "你已经离开的亲人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00075",
      "start_ms": 131920,
      "end_ms": 132975,
      "text": "真的可以回来一天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00076",
      "start_ms": 133230,
      "end_ms": 134525,
      "text": "你最想带他去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00077",
      "start_ms": 134880,
      "end_ms": 137720,
      "text": "我想很多人的答案并不是去什么多么昂贵的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00078",
      "start_ms": 137900,
      "end_ms": 140535,
      "text": "可能只是再回一次老家的房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00079",
      "start_ms": 140810,
      "end_ms": 142195,
      "text": "再吃一次妈妈做的饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00080",
      "start_ms": 142440,
      "end_ms": 144395,
      "text": "让爷爷看看自己现在的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00081",
      "start_ms": 144630,
      "end_ms": 145330,
      "text": "告诉奶奶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00082",
      "start_ms": 145450,
      "end_ms": 146730,
      "text": "我现在过得挺好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00083",
      "start_ms": 146910,
      "end_ms": 147905,
      "text": "你不用担心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00084",
      "start_ms": 148640,
      "end_ms": 150240,
      "text": "甚至什么都不用做，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00085",
      "start_ms": 150500,
      "end_ms": 152205,
      "text": "就想再和他坐一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00086",
      "start_ms": 152730,
      "end_ms": 153450,
      "text": "又到一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00087",
      "start_ms": 153450,
      "end_ms": 154125,
      "text": "中元节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00088",
      "start_ms": 154440,
      "end_ms": 155885,
      "text": "记得去看望我们的祖先，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00089",
      "start_ms": 156190,
      "end_ms": 157235,
      "text": "轻声说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00090",
      "start_ms": 157600,
      "end_ms": 158325,
      "text": "爷爷奶奶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38a9aa6c85ba92e8_s00091",
      "start_ms": 158660,
      "end_ms": 159405,
      "text": "我想你们。"
    }
  ],
